build/
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
tests/
scripts/
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# calculator.assistant.StrategyAssistant's model is fetched inside the build
# (backend/Dockerfile's `model` stage) from MODEL_URL, never copied in from
# the build context. If a .gguf were ever dropped under backend/ for local
# testing, excluding it here keeps it from bloating the context sent to the
# daemon and from ever reaching the builder stage through `COPY backend/
# /src/backend/` -- which has no verification step of its own and would ship
# whatever it found unchecked.
**/*.gguf
